				"description": "While performing a connectivity check on the ReqRes mock API (/api/users/2), the server returned a 401 Unauthorized response instead of the expected user data.\n\nUpon inspection of the response body, it was discovered that the API provider has implemented a new mandatory authentication requirement. The endpoint now requires a valid x-api-key header to be present in the request. This is currently blocking our login mockups and local development environments.\n\nTechnical Note: Confirmed that adding a placeholder x-api-key allows the request to pass, indicating this is a configuration change rather than a service outage."
